### EXP Lane Default (EXP)

- Items: Tough Boots, War Axe, Hunter Strike, Brute Force Breastplate, Queen's Wings, Immortality
- Core: War Axe, Hunter Strike, Brute Force Breastplate
- Emblem: Fighter Emblem with Vitality, Festival of Blood, Brave Smite
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Warrior Boots over Tough Boots when Use against mostly physical EXP lanes when control duration is not stopping Sora from finishing the second cast.; Malefic Roar over Immortality when Use when the enemy front line is stacking Physical Defense and your team still needs Sora to finish kills.; Sea Halberd over Immortality when Use against shield, healing, or high-extra-HP targets that recover through Sora's first engage.; Athena's Shield over Queen's Wings when Use when burst magic removes Sora before Queen's Wings can turn the fight.
- Total cost: 11050 gold

Default EXP setup for ranked games where Sora wants War Axe contact, Hunter Strike chase tempo, and enough durability to choose Thunder or Torrent after first contact.

### Torrent Frontline (EXP)

- Items: Tough Boots, War Axe, Cursed Helmet, Brute Force Breastplate, Oracle, Immortality
- Core: War Axe, Cursed Helmet, Brute Force Breastplate
- Emblem: Fighter Emblem with Vitality, Festival of Blood, Temporal Reign
- Battle spell: Vengeance
- Flex: Dominance Ice over Oracle when Use when attack-speed carries, healer drafts, or shield cores are forced to hit Sora during Torrent engages.; Guardian Helmet over Immortality when Use when repeated side-lane resets and siege defenses matter more than a one-fight revive.; Antique Cuirass over Oracle when Use against physical skill fighters or assassins that punish Sora before the second Torrent crowd-control beat.; Athena's Shield over Oracle when Use when one magic burst combo is the reason Sora cannot start fights with Vengeance.
- Total cost: 10560 gold

Frontline variant for drafts where Sora must start fights in Torrent, soak the first counterspell cycle, and keep cycling skills after Vengeance.

